@page "/"

<PageTitle>Blazor 2D - Multithreaded Benchmarks</PageTitle>

<div class="hero-section">
    <h1>Multithreaded Blazor <span class="accent">.NET 10</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Harnessing the power of multi-core processors directly in the browser with WebAssembly Threads.</p>
</div>

<div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🚀</div>
        <h3>High Performance</h3>
        <p>Run intensive computations on background Web Workers without blocking the UI thread.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🧵</div>
        <h3>Native Threads</h3>
        <p>Uses standard C# Threading, Task Parallel Library, and ThreadPool mapped to Browser Workers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Isolated Environment</h3>
        <p>COOP/COEP headers applied via Service Worker to enable SharedArrayBuffer security.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="action-box">
    <h3>Ready to test?</h3>
    <p>Choose a benchmark from the sidebar to start stressing the system.</p>
</div>

<style>
    .hero-section {
        padding: 40px 0;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero-section h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .accent {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--accent-glow);
    }

    .lead {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 20px;
        margin: 40px 0;
    }

    .feature-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        text-align: center;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .feature-card .icon {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .action-box {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #121212 0%, #1a1a1a 100%);
        padding: 40px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        text-align: center;
    }
</style>
